    [FEATURE] Add `with edit(layer):` to python

    Example:

        with edit(layer):
            f=layer.getFeatures().next()
            f[0]=5
            layer.updateFeature(f)

    This will automatically call commitChanges() in the end.
    If any exception occurs, it will rollBack() all the changes.

